            "sid": "ISA 41:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vindyai mbee wakwa, inyw’ĩ ĩthama; na ekai ngo sya andũ syeũvw’e vinya wasyo: ithengeee; na ĩndĩ ineene; tũthengeee vamwe ũsilĩlonĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HAB.2.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ava 2.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũũ wũkĩlĩtye ũmwe kuma wumĩlonĩ wa syũa, ũla ũmwĩtaa ũlũngalunĩ oke kũũnĩ kwake? Nũnenganae i mbaĩ kwake, na kũmũsumbĩkya ĩũlũ wa asumbĩ: nĩwinenganae ta kĩtoo ũvyũnĩ wake iũlũkaw’a nĩ ũta wake o ta mavuthĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
